      "text": "FUNGI: eukaryotes (like us) → hard to target selectively\n  Unique targets: ergosterol (membrane sterol vs cholesterol), cell wall (β-1,3-glucan)\n  Dimorphic: some switch mold (environmental) ↔ yeast (in host at 37°C)"
    },
