      "text": "PARASITES: eukaryotes; complex multi-stage life cycles; large diversity\n  Protozoa: unicellular (Plasmodium, Trypanosoma, Leishmania, Toxoplasma)\n  Helminths: multicellular worms (nematodes, trematodes, cestodes)\n  Ectoparasites: mites, lice, ticks (vectors for other pathogens)"
