      "text": "DRUG TARGETS:\n  Azoles (fluconazole, itraconazole, voriconazole, posaconazole):\n    Inhibit 14α-demethylase (CYP51, lanosterol → ergosterol step)\n    → accumulate toxic methylated sterols → membrane dysfunction\n    Fungistatic (not fungicidal); many drug interactions (CYP3A4)\n    Fluconazole: oral/IV, excellent CNS penetration; Candida, Cryptococcus\n    Voriconazole: broader — Aspergillus, Fusarium; visual disturbances\n    Isavuconazole: mucormycosis"
    },
    {
