      "text": "Polyenes (amphotericin B, nystatin):\n    Bind ergosterol directly → pores in membrane → ion leakage → cell death\n    Amphotericin B: IV, broad-spectrum, fungicidal; nephrotoxic (tubular injury)\n    Liposomal formulations (AmBisome): less nephrotoxic\n    Nystatin: topical only (too toxic for systemic use)"
    },
    {
