      },
      "text": "Echinocandins (caspofungin, micafungin, anidulafungin):\n    Inhibit β-1,3-glucan synthase → cell wall synthesis failure → cell death\n    Fungicidal against Candida; fungistatic against Aspergillus\n    IV only; minimal drug interactions; low toxicity\n    NO activity against Cryptococcus (no β-1,3-glucan in its wall)\n    Preferred for invasive Candida, especially in critical care"
    },
